    "description": "Grow your career with Yatra Hotels Holdings Services! We are hiring a Reservation Manager for our Surat team. Be part of a workplace that celebrates innovation, diversity, and performance.\n\nAbout Yatra Hotels Holdings Services:\nYatra Hotels Holdings Services is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Manage front office operations including check-in/check-out\n• Manage procurement of hotel supplies and control operating costs\n• Handle guest complaints and resolve issues promptly\n• Conduct regular guest satisfaction surveys and implement improvements\n• Assist in menu planning, costing, and food festival coordination\n• Monitor F&B service quality and maintain hygiene standards\n• Deliver exceptional guest experiences in line with brand standards\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Post Graduate Diploma in relevant field\n• 10-15 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Customer Relations\n• Proficiency in MICE\n• Proficiency in Opera PMS\n• Proficiency in Event Management\n• Proficiency in Tour Planning\n• Proficiency in Sommelier Skills\n• Proficiency in Housekeeping Standards\n• Proficiency in Barista Skills\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Flexible working hours\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Salary Range: 20 LPA - 40 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Surat, Gujarat, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Yatra Hotels Holdings Services!",
